                                                                  BUSINESS QUESTION
Which ticket categories are most likely to be reopened?


                                                                  Query:
SELECT   
    category,
    COUNT(*) AS total_tickets,
    SUM(CASE WHEN reopened = true THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS reopened_tickets,
    ROUND(
        SUM(CASE WHEN reopened = true THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)*100.0
        / COUNT(*),2
    ) AS reopen_rate
FROM customer_support
GROUP BY category
ORDER BY reopen_rate DESC;


                                                            Finding
Account Access had the highest ticket reopen rate among all support categories.

                                      
                                                   Why did it happen;
Account access had the highest reopen rate among all other categories, further analysis shows that Enterprise and Professional customers recorded the highest number of
reopened Account Access tickets. This suggests that account-related issues for these customers may be more difficult to fully resolve on the first attempt

                            
                                                 Recommendation:
Implement a thorough root cause analysis process to identify why tickets are being reopened. This helps in addressing not just the symptoms but the underlying issues.
Providing better troubleshooting guides, updating the knowledge base Training and development and giving agents additional training on these issues could help reduce the number of
reopened tickets.

